==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octo]] should be able to survive at least one hit from Ensanglion to be able to block waves properly. Extra Levels are always welcome so it can tank a few hits from Haniwanwan too. A table of minimum levels required with talents/talent orbs is below.

