If the player has access to Metal Cat, it is recommended to use him instead, as [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Macho]] is guaranteed to survive 12 hits. For damage, use [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]]. [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] is a great choice for a meatshield when accompanied with either [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] or [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]]. [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] can stall Ensanglion after his long attack animation, the same can be done with [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] but he is better used for money. If one owns [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]], it can be combined with Metal Cat and Boulder Cat to great effect, practically barring the Aku Gory and Sir Rel from advancing.

